# Copy this to local.nix (gitignored, at the repo root - not this file) and
# fill in real values. local.nix is imported automatically by every host if
# present (see flake.nix) - it's for personal information that shouldn't be
# hardcoded into this public repo, currently just a GPG key to import (see
# modules/options.nix for what each option does, and
# home/programs/gpg-import.nix for what actually happens with it).
#
# NOT YET VERIFIED to actually be picked up by flake evaluation when
# untracked/gitignored - see the caveat where this was introduced. If
# `couldinho.gpg.keyId` doesn't seem to take effect, that's most likely why.
{
  couldinho.gpg.keyId = "0123456789ABCDEF";
  couldinho.gpg.keyUrl = "https://example.com/pgp_keys.asc";
}
